  "description": "Jeong Na-Woon, a natural born gold digger and a man who fantasizes about even the smallest favor, ends up having an affair with Kyeong-Ha, whom he has had a crush on since childhood, while drunk. Although it was a drunken affair, Na-Woon thinks that the temperature and humidity that day were perfect, and now all that's left is to marry Kyeong-Ha, so he's in a happy mood... But contrary to Na-Woon's plans for a happy future, Kyeong-Ha says they should pretend it never happened...?\n\n *\"To you, hyung, I was really... just a dildo shuttle?\"*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
